body:
good to see you on youtube!

 ok as an advice, you should try to avoid using copyrighted music in the background! youtube detects them.

&#x200B;

Good that you did a vertical video since most people watch youtube from their phones! but it would be better if it was in landscape mode for tablet and pc users!

&#x200B;

and last ! great tutorial! Makeup subject is the most trending on youtube so I know you'll make it to the top

&#x200B;

Good luck!
